    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6366" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάγν-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>recognition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.116
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>reading,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthd.</u>
				279e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1462a17
			</span></i> (prob. l.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1414a18
			</span></i>, etc.: pl., Aristeas <i><span class="en">
				283
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>reading aloud,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				2.61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				13.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				959.8
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Chios</span>), <i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				642.11
			</span></i>: in pl., <i>public readings,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				81c
			</span></i>e; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώσεις τῷ θεῷ ποιούμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BCH</u>
					31.351
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Delos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Gramm., in textual criticism, <i>reading,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Ἀριστάρχειος ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					164.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πραγματεία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Olymp.
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				3.34
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>persuasion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> (misunderstanding <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.116
			</span></i>).</div>
